    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narb Fortunii is a short, story driven adventure filled with fun dialogue and music.\u00a0Move through the world and take in the different environments, characters, and sounds as the mystery of why you fell into this world unravels. <br><br>This linear adventure is not just one dimensional. Use the pause menu for help to continue to a 3D platforming challenge will bring you to the end, or restart you if the menu's music wasn't fully enjoyed.\u00a0Take off your specs and lock yourself into place, mid-air, to complete the final jumps that will bring you to the end.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narb Fortunii is a short, story driven adventure filled with fun dialogue and music.\u00a0Move through the world and take in the different environments, characters, and sounds as the mystery of why you fell into this world unravels. <br><br>This linear adventure is not just one dimensional. Use the pause menu for help to continue to a 3D platforming challenge will bring you to the end, or restart you if the menu's music wasn't fully enjoyed.\u00a0Take off your specs and lock yourself into place, mid-air, to complete the final jumps that will bring you to the end.  </p>",
